Package: finalproject
Title: Exploring Public Health Disparities in the United States
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Liuxi",
           family = "Qi",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "qiliuxi@gmail.com")
Description: This package explores public health disparities in the
    United States using publicly available datasets. It examines
    relationships between demographic, socioeconomic, and health
    outcomes through descriptive statistics and visualizations.
    The package provides reproducible analyses and reports
    developed for the BST260 final project.
